# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored; this file is not.

# Anthropic — the profiling, analysis, and strategy agents.
# Optional: with no key every stage falls back to deterministic output rather
# than failing, because the report has to render with the LLM absent.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Google Places — stage 2 (Competitor Finder) resolves competitors through
# Places rather than a web search, so `location` is verified rather than
# claimed. Unused until that stage is real; it returns fixtures today.
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
